# =============================================================================
# Socratic Backend Environment Variables
# =============================================================================

# 1. LLM API Key (Required for AI Socratic Tutor & Classifier)
# Get a fast, free key at https://console.groq.com
GROQ_API_KEY=your_groq_api_key_here

# Optional: OpenAI API Key fallback
# OPENAI_API_KEY=your_openai_api_key_here

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. Email Verification (Optional)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# By default, Socratic operates in DEMO OTP mode:
# When any student signs up with a .edu email, the 6-digit PIN is generated
# dynamically and displayed right on the verification screen and terminal logs.
#
# If you want REAL emails sent to student inboxes, configure SMTP below:

# --- Option A: Gmail SMTP (Free & Easy) ---
# 1. Go to your Google Account > Security > 2-Step Verification (turn ON).
# 2. Go to https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
# 3. Create an App name (e.g. "Socratic") and copy the 16-character password.
# 4. Uncomment and set the variables below:
# SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
# SMTP_PORT=465
# SMTP_USER=your_email@gmail.com
# SMTP_PASS=xxxx xxxx xxxx xxxx

# --- Option B: SendGrid / Resend / Mailgun ---
# SMTP_HOST=smtp.sendgrid.net
# SMTP_PORT=465
# SMTP_USER=apikey
# SMTP_PASS=your_sendgrid_api_key
